exports[`novaclaw CLI help-text snapshots every documented command emits stable help text: novaclaw import --help 1`] = `
"                                         
█▀▀▄ █▀▀█ █  █ █▀▀█ █▀▀▀ █    █▀▀█ █   █
█  █ █  █ █  █ █▀▀█ █    █    █▀▀█ █ █ █
▀  ▀ ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀  ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀▀▀

Commands:
  nova-cli completion          generate shell completion script
  nova-cli mcp                 manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers
  nova-cli run [message..]     run novaclaw with a message
  nova-cli debug               debugging and troubleshooting tools
  nova-cli providers           manage AI providers and credentials                   [aliases: auth]
  nova-cli agent               manage agents
  nova-cli upgrade [target]    upgrade novaclaw to the latest or a specific version
  nova-cli uninstall           uninstall novaclaw and remove all related files
  nova-cli serve               starts a headless novaclaw server
  nova-cli web                 start novaclaw server and open web interface
  nova-cli models [provider]   list all available models
  nova-cli stats               show token usage and cost statistics
  nova-cli export [sessionID]  export session data as JSON
  nova-cli pr <number>         fetch and checkout a GitHub PR branch, then run novaclaw
  nova-cli session             manage sessions
  nova-cli plugin <module>     install plugin and update config                      [aliases: plug]
  nova-cli db                  database tools

Options:
  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]
  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]
      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]
      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure        run without external plugins                                           [boolean]
"
`;

